/Title (Kalimah Tawhid teaches us about the absolute Oneness and greatness of Allah. It reminds us that Allah alone owns the entire universe, gives life, causes death and has complete power over everything. He is Ever-Living and will never die. Everything we have is from Allah and nothing can happen without His permission. This Kalimah strengthens our trust in Allah and encourages us to rely upon Him in every situation.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 634 0 R
/Prev 676 0 R
/Next 666 0 R
