/Title (Iman Mujmal is a summary of a Muslim's belief. It reminds us that we believe in Allah exactly as He has described Himself through His Beautiful Names and Perfect Attributes. A Muslim accepts everything that Allah has commanded because He is All-Knowing and Most Wise. True faith is not just something we say with our tongues; it must also be firmly believed in our hearts and shown through our actions. The stronger our faith becomes, the more we strive to obey Allah and live according to His guidance.)
