/Title (Iman Mufassal explains the six essential beliefs that every Muslim must have. These are belief in Allah, His angels, His revealed books, His messengers, the Last Day, and Divine Decree \(Qadr\). These beliefs form the foundation of Islam and help us understand why we worship Allah and prepare for the Hereafter. Knowing and believing these articles of faith strengthens our relationship with Allah and gives us confidence that everything happens according to Allah's perfect wisdom.)
